  "profileFaqTitle": "Frequently asked questions",
  "profileFaq1Question": "How do I use AntiBurnout?",
  "profileFaq1Answer": "Start on Home to see your wellbeing summary and daily motivation. Use Survey to complete an assessment, History to open previous results, and Profile to manage your information.",
  "profileFaq2Question": "How do I start a survey?",
  "profileFaq2Answer": "Open Survey or tap Start Assessment on Home. Read the introduction, then choose the answers that best match how you feel. Review your answers before submitting. Submission and prediction services are still in development.",
  "profileFaq3Question": "Where can I see previous results?",
  "profileFaq3Answer": "Open History and tap an assessment to view its details. Search and filters can help you find an entry. The results currently shown are sample data for the UI preview.",
  "profileFaq4Question": "Are assessment results a medical diagnosis?",
  "profileFaq4Answer": "No. Assessment results are not a medical diagnosis and do not replace consultation with a healthcare professional. Use this information for reflection and to better understand your wellbeing.",
  "profileFaq5Question": "How should I read the factors and answer summary?",
  "profileFaq5Answer": "The factors and summary explain what appears on the assessment result screen. In this preview version, the content is static sample data. The answer summary does not show how much each factor contributes to the prediction model.",
  "profileFaq6Question": "How do I change my name and photo?",
  "profileFaq6Answer": "Open Profile, then Edit Profile. Change your name or choose a photo from the gallery, then tap Save Changes. Changes are kept for the current app session and are not yet saved to the server.",
  "profileFaq7Question": "How do I change the app theme?",
  "profileFaq7Answer": "Open Profile, then Preferences. Choose Light or Dark, or choose System to follow your device theme. Reminders are still a preview and do not send notifications yet.",
